**Select and case statements**
--> select and case statement used to create intercative menus scripts in shell
scripting
--> case statement is used when you want to compare one variable with other
possible values.

sytnax:
case variable in
     pattern1)
        commands
        ;;
     pattern2)
        commands
        ;;
     pattern3)
        commands
        ;;
        *)
        commands
        ;;
esac

here,
case = starts the vase statement
variable = value to check
pattern) = possible values
;; = ends that block
*) = default case
esac = ends the case statement(case spelled backwords)

--select statement:
